window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>There will be tears....but Rytsar demands no less.</b></p> <p>Nothing fazes the sexy Russian. But how will he cope, when he finds out the tragedy that's befallen his comrade, the only man he calls Brother? When Rytsar can find no escape, he turns to Faelan to watch over Brie.</p> <p>Faelan is the misunderstood hero with a hidden past that holds him hostage. However, his allegiance lies with his friends at the Training Center, and he’ll do whatever it takes to protect them.</p> <p>He is ready when the time comes to rescue Rytsar Durov - one of their own - from the clutches of the <i>bratva</i>. The Russian should be dead, but his loyalties run as deep as his kinky passions and there is a promise Rytsar must keep....</p>"; 
